# Branch, commit, and checkout

Per [Superpowers](https://github.com/obra/superpowers).

## Branches

- **Use `ai/` prefix** — e.g. `ai/feature-name` (triggers auto-PR workflow).
- **Feature work needing isolation:** Use **using-git-worktrees** — create worktree with branch `ai/<feature>`, verify `.worktrees/` is gitignored.

## Commits

- Conventional format: `feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `chore:`. Add `Closes #<issue>` in body when addressing an issue.
- **Frequent commits** — one per logical step; commit after each green (per writing-plans).

## Checkout and completion

- **Implementation complete:** Use **finishing-a-development-branch** — verify tests, present 4 options, execute, cleanup worktree.
- **After PR or merge:** `git checkout main && git pull`. Leave workspace on `main`.
